# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Diego Milardovich et al. (2023). Machine learning interatomic potential for silicon-nitride (Si3N4) by active learning.
#   The Journal of Chemical Physics. doi:10.1063/5.0146753
#
# Version read: submittedVersion (sha256 a03e04767817e821...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 120 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: one GAP (SOAP descriptor) for amorphous and crystalline
# Si3N4 built by iterative active learning with melt-and-quench MD
# (structure types added per iteration in Table II), with the reference
# level and the test MAEs stated in the text.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
